			"notes": "## PayTp v2.0.1 Changelog\n\nUpdated on **2026-08-13**.\n\n### Emergency FIX\n\n- Fix bug where vanilla clients are blocked from server with PayTp mod installed.\n\n### How the BUG happens\n\n> The root cause is that a custom command argument type (pay-to-teleport:warp_name) is registered and used in the command tree. When a player joins, the server syncs the Brigadier command tree to the client. Vanilla/Fabric clients don't know how to deserialize this custom type, so Fabric treats it as the client missing the mod and rejects the connection.\n\n### How to upgrade\n\nDirectly replace the old **v2.0.0** version with the newer **v2.0.1** one.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/FLwolfy/Pay-To-Teleport/compare/v2.0.0...v2.0.1"
		},
