			"notes": "## PayTp v2.0.0 Changelog\n\nUpdated on **2026-07-31**.\n\n### Here it comes, version **2.0**!\n\nIn version 2.0, a brand new **fully-customizable** pricing system is now in use. Now server host can write your own *JEXL* file for price calculation, The JEXL file supports not only **minecraft commands** but also **shell commands** for widely-extensible usage. For futher details, please check [README](https://github.com/FLwolfy/Pay-To-Teleport/blob/latest/README.md).\n\n### What are changed in summary\n\n- Supported customized *JEXL* algorithm for price calculation\n- Added validations for client GUI settings\n- Enhanced `ptpwarp` commands with permission control, invitation system, and visibility settings\n- Added *safeTeleport* related settings\n- Added *setRespawnPoint* toggle setting for `ptphome`\n- Reorganized config data and its layout\n\n_*Due to changes in **config layout** and **storage data**, you may need to manually check and migrate your `config/paytp.json` config file and all the `paytp_*.dat` files. For more information on migration, please check [here](https://github.com/FLwolfy/Pay-To-Teleport/blob/latest/MIGRATION.md)._\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/FLwolfy/Pay-To-Teleport/compare/v1.2.1...v2.0.0"
		},
