			"notes": "## PayTp v1.2.0 Changelog\n\nUpdated on **2025-12-15**.\n\n- Added sound effects during teleportation. This feature can be disabled via the configuration.\n- Introduced a new \"warp\" command section for waypoint support:\n  - **Create**: Players can create global waypoints by standing on an activated beacon and using the command.\n  - **Delete**: Any player can delete any waypoint on the server.\n  - **Teleport**: Waypoints are publicly accessible to all players.\n  - **List**: Players can view all available server waypoints using `/ptpwrap list (page)`. Interactable GUI is supported.\n- Commands can now be disabled by setting their names to **empty strings** in the configuration file.\n- Removed payment messages when the teleport price is 0, allowing servers to offer teleportation without any cost.\n- Updated help messages to use **suggested command text** and polished message contents for clarity."
